t_uuid":"9fdb83de-637b-474c-9888-72266ad16f1f","position":{"commit_sha":"9b46be32e35072f855293ee99e1ae3187927e836","position":"1786950763402742001-9fdb83de-637b-474c-9888-72266ad16f1f"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"},{"content_hash":"43e1c82f782aa8b42ba646befaa74bc49eb977d7d861ca997491b4ab2ed47278","event_uuid":"46c1a2ce-fcb5-444f-b366-a78b7216953b","position":{"commit_sha":"3577c3a58b8a32acfe563e96c9487fc4017ac71e","position":"1786951161291239001-46c1a2ce-fcb5-444f-b366-a78b7216953b"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"},{"content_hash":"a46c7f4453c8257ec44bf512058c36e43a10853cd1601f0d34ae7ab2cd9957fe","event_uuid":"ce0042de-ba1f-4691-ac48-f4d51a507a83","position":{"commit_sha":"4eabb034929ea56b4a4818a65e684eefb15c32d6","position":"1786953407595858001-ce0042de-ba1f-4691-ac48-f4d51a507a83"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"}],"bridge_alerts":[],"bridge_project":null,"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"PLAN: Executing epic 905d (feline-springy-xenurine, RP-01 Pydantic-native structured output). Tree = 5 stories, all code-changing, strict dep chain / stack order: bf6b(S1 pai_output) -> 66b3(S2 pai_retry bounded op) -> {558e(S3 usage/failure contracts), 2e1b(S4 candidate tracing)} -> 10a3(S5 cutover+removal). Landing method: Gerrit (git push gerrit HEAD:refs/for/main), gates LLM-Review+1 & Verified+1. Gates: plan-review claim gate ON, completion+plan-review close gates ON. Worktree ../impl-rp01-pydantic-native branch impl-rp01-pydantic-native off origin/main ef97b9ab3f. LLM provider Bedrock (AWS creds present, us-west-2); no ANTHROPIC_API_KEY -> S5 operator-attested Anthropic canary is a likely hard blocker (needs human operator+creds).","timestamp":1786925911511124001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"Epic 905d plan-review PASS (advisory decision, 0 blocking; 2 deferred advisories P5/P6 @ priority 0.40 below 0.95 block line — noted for residual-gap sweep). Claimed epic 905d open->in_progress (assignee joeoakhart@navapbc.com). Model bedrock:us.anthropic.claude-sonnet-4-6. Proceeding Phase 3 dependency order starting S1 bf6b.","timestamp":1786926230452454001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"S1 bf6b plan-review #1 BLOCK (G6, critical, priority 0.70): plan didn't specify how the adapter reaches the full ModelResponse that check_response needs inside a Pydantic output hook. Remediated: specified TextOutput(fn) output-function for parse+validate (raises ModelRetry from StructuredOutputError, exact object in __cause__) + after_model_request capability hook (pydantic_ai 1.107.x, receives full ModelResponse) carrying check_response; UnretryableOutputError there is terminal (not ModelRetry), aborts after one call. Re-running review-plan.","timestamp":1786926773848511001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"S1 bf6b plan-review #2 PASS (attested, 0 blocking; advisories asked to empirically ground the after_model_request hook — verified: pydantic_ai 1.107.2 AbstractCapability.after_model_request(ctx,*,request_context,response:ModelResponse) exists, attaches via Agent(capabilities=[...]); FunctionModel E2E tests will prove ordering). Claimed S1 open->in_progress. Starting Phase 4 TDD held-out loop.","timestamp":1786927130032083001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"S1 TDD: authored full oracle tests/unit/test_pai_output.py (10 tests: 2 happy + 8 held-out edge/E2E: corpus-vs-pure-parser AC2, ModelRetry-cause-identity AC3, unretryable-not-wrapped, invalid-then-valid retry, refusal/length/provider_details terminal AC4, no-scheduling/usage/persistence import guard AC5). Confirmed RED (module absent). Validated oracle soundness: all 8 corpus items parse to expected _Verdict via structured.parse_structured; check_stop_reason raises UnretryableOutputError on content_filter/length/refusal. Held out full oracle to session files/held-out-s1; trimmed in-tree file to 2 happy tests only. Dispatching held-out implementer.","timestamp":1786927406583728001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"S1 VALIDATED against held-out oracle: all 17 tests GREEN (implementer saw only 2 happy). Mutation teeth confirmed: disabling guard -> 3 refusal/truncation/provider_details tests RED; not re-raising UnretryableOutputError terminally -> unretryable-wrap test RED. Preflight: make lint PASS, make typecheck PASS (553 files), targeted tests 88 passed (pai_output 17 + structured 71). Committed c6655bf129 (Change-Id I20aeb0ae, rebar-ticket + DCO). Pushed to Gerrit change 1834: https://rebar.solutions.navateam.com/c/rebar/+/1834 . Awaiting LLM-Review +1 and Verified +1.","timestamp":1786927719548625001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"S1 PS1 review: LLM-Review+1 PASS, Verified pending. 2 advisory findings (correctness+tests) flagged a real behavioral PARITY gap: guard_capability propagated a RETRYABLE StructuredOutputError (finish_reason='error' transient) as a non-ModelRetry -> PAI aborts instead of retrying. Per skill (behavioral finding -> RED test first): added held-out test_transient_error_finish_reason_retries_not_aborts (confirmed RED for right reason: transient error aborted run), then fixed guard to translate retryable StructuredOutputError -> ModelRetry (terminal UnretryableOutputError still propagates) + docstring. Full oracle 18 GREEN, lint+typecheck+complexity clean. Amended (Change-Id preserved), pushed PS2 to change 1834. Awaiting re-vote.","timestamp":1786928542262302001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"S1 PS2 review: LLM-Review+1 PASS. 2 advisory (test-quality) findings: (1) corpus parity test tautological (both operands same parse_structured call); (2) guard __cause__ identity contract untested. Both fixed test-only in PS3: corpus test now asserts independent expected _Verdict(verdict=PASS) + parity; added test_guard_retryable_error_preserves_exact_cause and test_guard_unretryable_error_is_not_wrapped (direct on after_model_request). Oracle now 20 GREEN, lint clean. pai_output.py unchanged. Pushed PS3 to change 1834. PS2 CI was green on lint+typecheck+py3.11+py3.12 (py3.13 in-flight, superseded). Awaiting PS3 gates.","timestamp":1786929428225586001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"S1 (bf6b) LANDED-GREEN & CLOSED. PS3: LLM-Review+1 PASS (no findings) AND Verified+1 SUCCESS (CI run 31984497900, full matrix ubuntu 3.11/3.12/3.13 + macos 3.13 green). Checked off all 5 acceptance-criteria boxes (satisfied by 20-test oracle). Completion-verifier close gate PASSED. transitioned bf6b in_progress->closed; unblocked S2 (66b3). Gerrit change 1834 remains in review stack (submit at Phase 6). Next: S2 66b3 review-plan + claim + TDD held-out loop.","timestamp":1786932081467360001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"S2 66b3-4214-c70b-4a9a plan-review PASS at iter 11 (certified attestation, 0 blocking, 3 advisory accepted non-blocking per convergence). Description trimmed to 7999 chars; deep grounding relocated to a ticket comment. Claimed S2 open to in_progress. Beginning Phase 4 held-out TDD loop.","timestamp":1786938512424866001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"S2 TDD RED evidence: happy (test_rp01_s2_bounded_op_happy.py: prompted invalid-then-valid is one bounded op, requests==2) RED (current==1). Held-out oracle (test_rp01_s2_bounded_op_oracle.py): 5 RED-first (wire-INCLUDE-on-fit, ContextWindowExceededError, concision-reclassification, bounded-exhaustion 3 calls, build_usage_limits base+allowance), 2 preservation-green (content_filter + provider_details refusal terminal), 1 boundary-teeth-green (wire-OMIT). Two existing seam tests updated to base+allowance contract and confirmed RED. Added ContextWindowExceededError(LLMRunnerError) stub to errors.py. Next: hold out oracle, dispatch implementer.","timestamp":1786939282144590001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"S2 held-out validation complete. All 3 oracle failures were TEST defects, not impl: (1+2) omit/exceed tests calibrated to 200k window but real resolved candidate opus-4-8 has 1M window - recalibrated to compute window dynamically via own_window_tokens(_pai_model(cfg)); (3) concision instruction lands as RetryPromptPart in ModelRequest not ModelResponse - added _wire_request_texts helper. Impl pai_retry.py fit logic verified CORRECT. Mutation teeth: naive always-include flips omit+exceed RED. Full oracle 8 green + happy 1 green.","timestamp":1786941173376741001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"S2 preflight GREEN: full non-integration suite 13565 passed / 52 skipped / 0 failed (git env neutralized). Found+fixed one real regression: test_silent_success::test_reask_bounds_a_huge_faulty_prior_reply encoded the OLD truncated-snippet-into-prompt contract that S2 replaces with the window-fit wire projection - rewrote it to assert whole-omission of a window-exceeding faulty reply using a deep sentinel (teeth: fits=carried, exceeds=omitted). All other suite failures were the host GIT_CONFIG safe.bareRepository=explicit injection (bare-repo tests), environmental, absent in CI. make lint + typecheck green.","timestamp":1786946743448546001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"S2 committed 707f9f5719 (Change-Id I55d9bbe0, rebar-ticket 66b3-4214-c70b-4a9a, DCO signed) and pushed to Gerrit as change 1835: https://rebar.solutions.navateam.com/c/rebar/+/1835 - stacked on S1 (push new:1, S1 recognized server-side). Awaiting Verified +1 (CI ~13-15min) and LLM-Review +1.","timestamp":1786946827471868001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"S2 CI patchset 1 essentially green (all ubuntu pytest 3.11/3.12/3.13 + lint/typecheck/mutation pass; macos pending). LLM-Review +1 PASS with 4 advisories. Addressed 2 genuine oracle-coverage gaps (finding 1: transient finish_reason=error -> bounded ModelRetry recovery; finding 4: lowered structured_retry_limit lowers the constructed request_limit addend) - both added with confirmed mutation teeth. Deferred/accepted findings 2 (ContextWindowExceededError message framing - semantics correct: response input_tokens IS authoritative input) and 3 (exhaustion substring-match on pydantic-ai message - documented contract, low risk). Amended to f8c97df261 (Change-Id preserved), re-pushing.","timestamp":1786948286047867001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"S2 (66b3-4214) Gerrit change 1835 patchset 2: LLM-Review +1 AND Verified +1 (CI run 32002028002 success; mutation gate auto-skipped for this patchset). Both gates green. Closing S2.","timestamp":1786950763402742001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"S2 close gate flagged AC#7 (NativeOutput branch + bug-895c fallback) as unchecked. Audit found it was a genuine held-out coverage gap: no test exercised the native branch through _pai_structured nor the runtime 895c fallback. Added 2 oracle tests: native-branch-runs-under-bounded-op-and-keeps-truncation-terminal (native routes via output_mode, guard_capability terminal not concision) and native-grammar-compilation-rejection-falls-back-to-prompted-path. Both GREEN; mutation teeth confirmed (concision-swap kills #1, always-raise kills #2). Lint+typecheck clean, 159 affected-suite tests pass. Amending S2 commit -> patchset 3.","timestamp":1786951161291239001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"S2 AC#3 audit: unknown-count case and all_messages()-retention invariant were unverified. Added oracle test unknown-count-response-is-omitted-but-retained-in-full-history via the public wire_history_processor seam (unknown usage -> omitted whole from wire copy; retained in original history = non-mutating; known-small kept = teeth). GREEN; mutation (drop inp<=0 guard) kills it. All 8 acceptance criteria now genuinely covered by tests. Amending -> patchset 4.","timestamp":1786953407595858001}],"created_at":1786925892445064001,"creation_channel":"cli","deps":[{"link_uuid":"bf95baa6-ebcd-4a79-85fd-4d46135fac52","relation":"relates_to","target_id":"905d-1287-effc-4a83"}],"description":"","env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","file_impact":[],"file_impact_scope":"undeclared","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[["relates_to","905d-1287-effc-4a83"]],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":[],"ticket_id":"1c87-df93-4f9e-4b7c","ticket_type":"session_log","title":"Implement feline-springy-xenurine (RP-01): Pydantic-native structured-output operation","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["f3ff79d7-e7ff-43a5-ad3b-eed52f0a3b0b","76c0d5df-44d8-476c-88b3-d20485bce594","420835a4-1bd3-49c8-aaba-0d88d461c25a","ee621054-7c20-40b3-adf6-d00f3f03e14a","5aabe6d3-0416-4d9d-9cdd-2b233898c5ff","23aabbf9-b8d4-4459-91d5-9a5875f4b58b","108cad03-2471-4b92-ba95-2332729d80b5","e0e8ea7e-25f2-4588-a22a-960836893636","61be052c-33cc-4cf8-9966-edbdeab5f0c6","40cccebd-cc8b-410b-b133-43d2030d61b7","5c330d36-e2c4-40a7-8b2c-fb380a10f35f","3540883a-9b05-486f-b702-5b3b629c66b7","b84fb779-874a-485a-bae9-5a6744eb6c20","9fdb83de-637b-474c-9888-72266ad16f1f","46c1a2ce-fcb5-444f-b366-a78b7216953b","ce0042de-ba1f-4691-ac48-f4d51a507a83"]},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1786953407595858002,"uuid":"7ebe90c7-bad6-4ac9-a177-e15cabe28997"}